---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const effectiveDate = "January 2, 2026";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | Daniel Black Applications" description="Terms of service for applications by Daniel Black">
  <main class="relative z-10 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
      <header class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-brand mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">Effective Date: {effectiveDate}</p>
        <p class="text-text-tertiary mt-2">Applications by Daniel Black (danaucpe.org)</p>
      </header>

      <article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8">

        <section class="bg-bg-secondary/50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-error/30">
          <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary mb-4">Restricted Access</h2>
          <div class="p-4 bg-error/10 border border-error/30 rounded-lg">
            <p class="text-error font-heading mb-2">Black Family Members Only</p>
            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Access to these applications is strictly limited to Daniel Black and authorized
              members of the Black household. If you are not a Black family member, you are
              not authorized to use these applications or connect any accounts. No exceptions
              or permissions will be granted for third-party access.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-bg-secondary/50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-border-subtle">
          <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary mb-4">Purpose</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            These applications are experimental, non-commercial personal tools developed by Daniel Black
            exclusively for Black family use. They are designed for personal wellness tracking, data integration,
            and AI-assisted productivity within the household.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-bg-secondary/50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-border-subtle">
          <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary mb-4">Non-Commercial Use</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            These applications are strictly personal family tools and are not offered as commercial services.
            They are not available to the public under any circumstances. No permissions will be granted
            for third-party use, data access, or integration.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-bg-secondary/50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-border-subtle">
          <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary mb-4">Data Access & Consent</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            By authorizing these applications to access third-party services:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-text-secondary space-y-2 ml-4 mt-4">
            <li>You consent to the application accessing your data as described in the <a href="/privacy" class="text-brand hover:text-brand-light">Privacy Policy</a></li>
            <li>You acknowledge that OAuth 2.0 authentication is used with explicit user permission</li>
            <li>You may revoke access at any time through the connected service's settings</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-bg-secondary/50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-border-subtle">
          <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary mb-4">Medical Disclaimer</h2>
          <div class="p-4 bg-warning/10 border border-warning/30 rounded-lg">
            <p class="text-warning font-heading mb-2">Important Health Notice</p>
            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Insights, analysis, and summaries generated by these applications are for informational
              purposes only. They should not be considered medical advice or used to replace professional
              medical diagnosis, treatment, or consultation.
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-4">
            Always consult with qualified healthcare providers for medical decisions.
            These tools are designed to complement, not replace, professional medical care.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-bg-secondary/50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-border-subtle">
          <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary mb-4">Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            These applications are provided "as is" without warranties of any kind.
            The author (Daniel Black) assumes no responsibility for:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-text-secondary space-y-2 ml-4 mt-4">
            <li>Decisions made based on data or insights from these applications</li>
            <li>Data accuracy, availability, or reliability</li>
            <li>Service interruptions or technical issues</li>
            <li>Any consequences arising from the use of these tools</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-bg-secondary/50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-border-subtle">
          <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary mb-4">Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            All code, designs, and content created for these applications remain the intellectual
            property of Daniel Black unless otherwise specified.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-bg-secondary/50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-border-subtle">
          <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            These applications integrate with third-party services (e.g., Oura Ring, fitness platforms).
            Use of those services is subject to their respective terms of service and privacy policies.
            This agreement does not supersede or modify those terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-bg-secondary/50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-border-subtle">
          <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary mb-4">Modifications</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            These terms may be updated from time to time. The effective date at the top of this page
            indicates when these terms were last revised. Continued use of the applications after
            changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-bg-secondary/50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-border-subtle">
          <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-text-primary mb-4">Contact</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            For questions about these terms of service, contact Daniel Black:
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4">
            <a href="mailto:dan@danaucpe.org" class="text-brand hover:text-brand-light transition-colors">
              dan@danaucpe.org
            </a>
          </p>
        </section>

      </article>

      <footer class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-border-subtle flex gap-8">
        <a href="/" class="text-brand hover:text-brand-light transition-colors font-heading">
          ← Back to Daemon
        </a>
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary transition-colors font-heading">
          Privacy Policy
        </a>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
